                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">ShapeDiver outputs: the display layers from the logic script (street, plots, green, retail, residential, office, black edges) plus the block labels (Squid text curves at the block centroids, hidden with Show Block Labels) are entwined into one branch per material for the glTF 2.0 display; material colours come from the script (grey or by use). The urban report JSON goes to the Direct Data Output "AgentMetric"; the agent's get_output tool reads it by that name (the tool description points agents to AgentMetric).</item>
